Description: colored sticky notes for GNOME
 Sticky Notes keeps quick colored notes in a searchable list. Any note
 can pop out into its own small window on the desktop.
 .
 Notes support bold, italic, underline, strikethrough, bullet,
 numbered and check lists, links and images. Reminders pop a note out
 with a notification. Screenshots go into a note through the desktop
 portal, and with tesseract-ocr installed the text in images is
 searchable. Notes also show up in the GNOME Activities search.
